00:00:47.129 --> 00:00:51.760
In a film with otherwise normal performances
and cinematography, Cage spoke like this

00:00:51.760 --> 00:01:02.019
“The work's not just going to go away Alva,
it never just goes away… (none descript

00:01:02.019 --> 00:01:03.539
